OL,3,AChristina Applegate says she was
OL,4,Awrongly diagnosed with MS
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristina Applegate thought she was
OL,7,Fliving with multiple sclerosis (MS) for
OL,8,Ffive years, until recently discovering
OL,9,Fshe had been given a wrong diagnosis.
OL,11,FThe actress, known for hits like
OL,12,FAnchorman and Married With Children,
OL,13,Fsaid she was "not happy at all" about
OL,14,Fthe news and in tears when she found
OL,15,Fout.
OL,17,F"You don't get misdiagnosed and then
OL,18,Fall of the sudden I'm better,"
OL,19,FApplegate said in an episode of her
OL,20,FMessy podcast released on Tuesday. "If
OL,21,Fanything, I've gotten worse."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
